Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-15. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Lane Default (EXP)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Sea Halberd, Windtalker
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Rose Gold Meteor over Windtalker when Use against magic burst that can reach you before the front line stabilizes.; Thunder Belt over Windtalker when Use when survivability and stickiness matter more than pure attack speed.; Blade of Despair over Sea Halberd when Use when ahead and the enemy draft has no sustain or shield threats to punish.
- Total cost: 10870 gold

Default EXP lane split-push build. Corrosion Scythe plus Demon Hunter Sword is the two-item spike where clones start sticking and draining. Golden Staff multiplies attack effects across all bodies.

### Jungle Tempo (Jungle)

