- Blessing: Bloody Retribution
- Flex: Windtalker over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when the enemy team lacks magic burst and extra attack speed accelerates objective clears.; Thunder Belt over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when you need defense and a slow proc to keep targets inside the clone pile longer.; Immortality over Rose Gold Meteor when Use for late game Lord fights when one revive is worth more than a shield or extra damage.
